@startuml
title Architecture Diagram - TravelWise (as implemented)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Employee /\nSupervisor" as User

package "Presentation Tier" {
  [React SPA (Vite)] as UI
}

package "Application Tier" {
  [Node.js / Express API] as API
  [Scoring Engine\n(rule-based)] as Scoring
}

package "Emerging Technology Tier" {
  [Python / Flask\nCost Prediction Service] as ML
  database "model.joblib\n(Random Forest)" as Model
}

package "Data Tier (Cloud)" {
  database "Supabase\n(PostgreSQL + Auth)" as DB
}

User --> UI : HTTPS (browser)
UI --> API : REST JSON\n/api/*
API --> DB : REST (service role)
API --> Scoring : generate + score options
API --> ML : POST /predict-cost
ML --> Model : load / predict
UI ..> DB : Auth only\n(publishable key)

note right of ML
  Currently runs as a local
  process (localhost:8000).
  Cloud deployment (Render)
  is a planned, not yet
  completed, target — see
  Limitations (5.4).
end note

@enduml
